WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.999 line:0
Ten and a half: East deals first, North bets.
Over 10.5 busts; J, Q, K count half a point.

00:00:06.999 --> 00:00:11.999 line:0
North picks the 100 chip and clicks Bet.
The dealer, East, does not bet.

00:00:11.999 --> 00:00:14.999 line:0
Each player gets one hidden card;
North’s own hidden card is a 10.

00:00:14.999 --> 00:00:22.999 line:0
North clicks Hit and gets a face-up J♠:
10 plus a half is exactly 10.5, so the hand ends.

00:00:22.999 --> 00:00:26.499 line:0
The player is done; dealer East acts.

00:00:26.499 --> 00:00:33.998 line:0
East stands and all cards are shown: North’s
ten and a half (×2) beats 8 and wins 200.

00:00:33.998 --> 00:00:40.098 line:0
Fast-forward: North deals; East bets and hits,
then North clicks Hit and Stand itself.

00:00:40.098 --> 00:00:47.998 line:0
East busts and loses. In hand three North draws
five cards without busting: Five Small, ×3.

00:00:47.998 --> 00:00:52.298 line:0
Last hand: North deals and East has stood.
North’s hidden card is 8: click Hit.

00:00:52.298 --> 00:00:58.997 line:0
North draws a 5 for 13 and busts;
East’s 9 still wins against a busted dealer.

00:00:58.997 --> 00:01:08.000 line:0
Hands done: North 1,500, East 500.
North wins on total chips left after four hands.
